@startuml l03-decoder-overview
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK TC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8F0FE
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam ArrowColor #4A6FA5

title 第 3 講地圖：decoder

:3 條輸入（row 位址）
→ 3-to-8 decoder
→ 8 條輸出，剛好 1 條是 1（one-hot）;
:內部：3 個 NOT + 8 個 AND
每個 AND 吃 3 條：原值或反相;
:加一條 enable
→ 每個 AND 變 4 個輸入
→ enable = 0 時全部輸出 0;
#E6F4EA:兩顆 3-to-8 + 1 個 NOT 接 enable
→ 4-to-16 decoder;
@enduml
